      "패킹 SDR형 | ILJIN 베어링": "Packing SDR Type | ILJIN Bearing",
      "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Dust Seal / Packing SDR Type</p> <h2>더스트씰 · 패킹 SDR형</h2> <p>이물질 유입을 막는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">더스트 씰</strong>로 사용하는 패킹 SDR형입니다.</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Dust Seal / Packing SDR Type</p> <h2>Dust Seal · Packing SDR Type</h2> <p>The packing SDR type is used as a <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">dust seal</strong> to prevent foreign material from entering.</p>",
      "<img src=\"assets/packing_sdr_diagram.png\" alt=\"패킹 SDR형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이 · t=폭</span></p>": "<img src=\"assets/packing_sdr_diagram.png\" alt=\"Packing SDR Type Drawing\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-section<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=Inner diameter · D=Outer diameter · H=Height · t=Width</span></p>"
    },
