      "<img src=\"assets/packing_sdr_diagram.png\" alt=\"패킹 SDR형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이 · t=폭</span></p>": "<img src=\"assets/packing_sdr_diagram.png\" alt=\"パッキンSDR形図面\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 断面図<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=内径 ・ D=外径 ・ H=高さ ・ t=幅</span></p>"
    },
